'''Teacher! It's Spring''' (春だよ！高校教師, ''Harudayo! Kōkō Kyōshi'', '''It's Spring! High School Teacher''') is the April event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Teacher! It's Spring!'''}} is back in the Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to confront the first stirrings of a innocent schoolcat's crush...<br>
Will your dreams be crushed by the impossibly cool {{Color|#FF9900|'''Teacher A'''}}?!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available April 1st (11:00am) thru May 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Maiden Cat'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|100%}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|Treasure Radar item}}!)

※ After you have picked up Maiden Cat, unlock it at the {{Color|#34A853|Rare Cats}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Maiden Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

